/Title (2024-25, the market is estimated at USD 7-8 billion with a compound annual growth rate of 14-16%. Two platforms -- Swiggy and Zomato -- together account for over 90% of all online food delivery orders in India. The sector is characterised by hyper-local operations, thin unit economics, high customer price sensitivity, and intense competition for restaurant supply. The post-pandemic period saw a dramatic acceleration in adoption, particularly in tier-2 cities such as Jaipur, Lucknow, Chandigarh, and Kochi.)
